            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A package (1600) is disclosed comprising a frame (1700) that provides structure, a sidewall (1710) fused to the frame, and a tethered cap (1610) connected to an end of the frame. The tethered cap (1610) includes a tab element (1630), a peelable portion (1640), and a tether mechanism (1650) that connects the peelable portion to a remaining part of the cap. To open the package, the tab element (1630) is used to peel away the peelable portion (1640), exposing an opening to access the package contents. A portion (1632) of the tab element (1630) is configured to be fused to an outer surface of the sidewall (1710) in the closed state, providing a tamper-evident seal.</p>
            </abstract>
